# Vosk models, ONNX

[ONNX](https://onnx.ai) exports of the [vosk](https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models)
ASR models (the acoustic model `am/final.mdl` converted to
`am/final.onnx` / `am/final.int8.onnx`; `conf/`, `ivector/` and `graph/`
are unchanged from the original model), produced with
[`scripts/vosk/`](https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/tree/master/scripts/vosk).
Every export is gated against kaldi (row-by-row AM parity) and against
the transcript of a test wav before it is uploaded.

Each language lives in its own folder under [`asr/<lang>/`](asr); per
model you find:

| file | what it is |
|---|---|
| `<name>-onnx.zip` | the model with the float32 AM (`am/final.onnx`) |
| `<name>-onnx-int8.zip` | the model with the quantized AM (`am/final.int8.onnx`) |
| `<name>.md` | info page: contents (`tree`), file sizes (`ls -lh`), license |

